(7290127, 1136649, 138253, '<td valign="top">have to say, the people don''t really look like either one are happy to be doing this. it''s almost like it''s a brother getting a kiss from his sister and the girl looks like she''s contractually obligated to do this but is going to make the photog pay up immediately upon the shutter being pressed.<br/> <br/>on the positive, the models are well lit, clearly in focus and attractive in their own right, and in terms of size compared to the card, they are well proportioned, it''s just not my idea of a Christmas card<br/> <br/>still a 7 on technicals</td>', 'have to say, the people don''t really look like either one are happy to be doing this. it''s almost like it''s a brother getting a kiss from his sister and the girl looks like she''s contractually obligated to do this but is going to make the photog pay up immediately upon the shutter being pressed. on the positive, the models are well lit, clearly in focus and attractive in their own right, and in terms of size compared to the card, they are well proportioned, it''s just not my idea of a Christmas card still a 7 on technicals', '2014-12-05 11:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
